FAIL testdata/bad/duplicate-step.yaml:5:11  PQ2001: two steps are called "extract"

   3 |   - name: extract
   4 |     run: ["/bin/true"]
>  5 |   - name: extract
                 ^
   6 |     run: ["/bin/false"]

   Step 1 already has that name. A step name is how a failure says which step
   failed, how needs points at it and how a retry names it, so two steps cannot
   share one. Rename this one:

       - name: extract-2

   paceq error PQ2001  for the full explanation
